0..70 Comment "// Two data types with one shape are distinct: a `Celsius` value is no"
71..147 Comment "// `Fahrenheit`, whether the source ascribes it the other type or names that"
148..222 Comment "// type through an alias; its twin, `model/data/one-shape-families.gandr`,"
223..296 Comment "// carries the value along the path an equivalence makes. The mismatch is"
297..366 Comment "// written again as the run target, which the lowering reads no final"
367..445 Comment "// expression as yet (#1105), so that refusal stands in front of the mismatch."
